### docusaurus
.docusaurus
build
docs/*
!docs/generate-dryrun-performance-analysis.md
!docs/capabilities/
!docs/capabilities/**
static
betterpptx-mcp/.research-unlock
# Research/demo artifacts (harnesses, generated .pptx/.mp4/.png). Kept on disk for review,
# not committed (binaries). Owner directive 2026-07-08: never delete demo files.
research-demos/
# Local MCP registry holds live API keys/tokens — never commit it. Track .mcp.example.json
# (redacted template) instead; copy it to .mcp.json and fill in secrets locally.
.mcp.json
# CMU/BVH raw motion for the presenter clip-baker — a build-time-only asset (staged from a private bucket).
# CMU terms allow baking into a sold product but FORBID redistributing the motion as data, so raw BVH must
# never enter git or any shipped layer. Only baked skeletal tracks ride in the GLB.
*.bvh
betterpptx-mcp/deploy/model3d-worker/mocap/*.fbx
betterpptx-mcp/deploy/model3d-worker/mocap/*.bvh
betterpptx-mcp/deploy/model3d-worker/mocap/
# Mixamo source FBX pack (characters + gesture takes) — licensed SOURCE assets, staged locally like mocap/.
# Only baked derivatives (kinetic-clips.glb skeletal tracks) enter git; raw sources need a G5 record first.
Gestures_Pack_Basic/
# nvdiffrast (NVIDIA Source Code License, NON-COMMERCIAL) — eval-only shim; must never ride a git-based
# build or any default/shipped path (owner doctrine: NC out of default paths).
betterpptx-mcp/deploy/model3d-worker/nvdiffrast_drtk/

# Local-only OCR/runtime and scratch media. These remain on disk for research
# review but are not source or release provenance inputs.
/eng.traineddata
/betterpptx-mcp/eng.traineddata
/.tmp-avatar-selfie-overlay-*/
/consentedHumanAsset/
/Meshy_AI_Casual_Denim_Look_biped/
/tmp_media-*.mp4
/tmp_media-*.wav
/visual-progress.html
/subagent_tool_invocations.log
# Generated by google-github-actions/auth; do not commit short-lived federated credentials.
gha-creds-*.json
